---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="h-full w-full brand-gradient opacity-10"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-dark">The Sourcing Partner Your Infrastructure Team Doesn't Have Time To Be</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-gray-700">Speed. Vendor Access. Expertise. For integrators scaling across South Florida, LATAM & Caribbean.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/contact#project" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-brand-green px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow hover:bg-emerald-600">Describe Your Project</a>
        <a href="/contact#call" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-brand-blue px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-blue hover:bg-blue-50">Book a Strategy Call</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">48‑hour sourcing standard. No bloat. Just results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/CERN_Computer_Center_03.jpg/1280px-CERN_Computer_Center_03.jpg" alt="Data center corridor with server racks" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover rounded-xl ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/stock/server-room.svg';" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-8 bg-white border-y border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-gray-600">TRUSTED BY INSTALLERS & DISTRIBUTORS ACROSS SOUTH FLORIDA, LATAM & CARIBBEAN</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-12 bg-gray-50" id="stats">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue">$20M+</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">Infrastructure Sourced</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">For integrators across our markets</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue">60+</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">Active Integrators & Distributors</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Trust us with their sourcing</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue">48 Hours</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">Sourcing Standard</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Not 2 weeks. 48 hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue">15–25%</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">Better Pricing</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Through vendor & distributor relationships</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16" id="how">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">How It Works</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600">From project specs to sourcing in 48 hours</p>
    <img src="/images/diagrams/how-it-works-en.svg" alt="Six-step sourcing timeline" class="mt-8 hidden lg:block w-full"/>
    <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 1</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">You Tell Us</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Specs, budget, timeline, design questions.</p></div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 2</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">We Design</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Right BOM with options & rationale.</p></div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 3</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">We Source Globally</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">USA, LATAM, China.</p></div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 4</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">We Negotiate</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Pricing, terms, delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 5</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">You Buy</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">From us or supplier.</p></div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200 bg-white"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Step 6</p><p class="font-bold mt-1">You Execute</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Install. We handle issues.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50" id="services">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">What We Do</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600">The services that make sourcing fast, pricing better, and design smarter</p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Rapid Sourcing</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">We source BOMs in 48 hours — not 2 weeks. Best products, pricing, and delivery terms.</p></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Strategic Distributor Partnerships</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Better pricing, flexible terms, priority inventory & delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Vendor Access</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Relationships across USA, LATAM, China. Priority pricing & delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Design Guidance (Optional)</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">1000+ projects designed. Optional takeoff design: $175.</p></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Supply Option</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Buy through us or direct. We coordinate logistics and delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Warranty Support</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">If you buy from us, we manage vendor issues & RMAs.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Gallery: In the Field (self-hosted images) -->
<section class="py-12 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-black">In the Field</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600">From cabling to data centers across our regions</p>
    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/Fiber_Optical_Cable.jpg" alt="Fiber optical cable bundle in rack" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Structured Cabling — Fiber Cable Bundle</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/CERN_Computer_Center_02.jpg" alt="Server racks in data center" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Server Racks — Data Center</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/Fiber_optic2.jpg" alt="Fiber optics strands" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Fiber Optics — Close‑up</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cable_tray_with_cables.jpg?width=1280" alt="Cable trays with cables in a data center" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/stock/network-cables.svg';" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Network — Cable Trays</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Communication_Cables.jpg" alt="Communication cables" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Communications — Outside Plant</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="relative group">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ethernet_switch.jpg?width=1280" alt="Network switch close-up" class="w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-md ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/stock/network-switch.svg';" />
        <figcaption class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 rounded-md bg-black/55 px-2 py-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md ring-1 ring-black/20">Network Switch — Close‑up</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16" id="about">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Who We Serve</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">Infrastructure integrators across low-voltage cabling, CCTV, data centers, power distribution & cooling, and network infrastructure.</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm">
        <li>• Low-voltage cabling & connectivity</li>
        <li>• CCTV & security systems</li>
        <li>• Data centers & structured cabling</li>
        <li>• Power distribution & cooling</li>
        <li>• Network infrastructure</li>
        <li>• Mixed verticals</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600">Located in: South Florida, LATAM, Caribbean</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 ring-1 ring-gray-200 p-6">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Why Connietech</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
        <li>• Speed — 48‑hour sourcing standard</li>
        <li>• Network — Vendor & distributor relationships</li>
        <li>• Credibility — 20+ years of experience</li>
        <li>• Global Access — USA, LATAM, China</li>
        <li>• Flexibility — Commission, resale, or hybrid</li>
        <li>• No Overhead — You pay for results</li>
      </ul>
      <img src="/images/charts/pricing-improvement.svg" alt="Chart showing 15–25% better pricing" class="mt-4 w-full max-w-sm"/>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Diagrams: Global sourcing + Speed comparison -->
<section class="py-12 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-black">Global sourcing coverage</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600">USA, LATAM, and China — vendor and distributor relationships you can leverage.</p>
      <img src="/images/diagrams/global-sourcing.svg" alt="Global sourcing coverage map" class="mt-4 w-full rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-black">Speed that saves projects</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-gray-600">Our 48‑hour standard vs typical two weeks — less downtime, faster delivery.</p>
      <img src="/images/diagrams/speed-comparison.svg" alt="48 hours vs 2 weeks speed comparison" class="mt-4 w-full rounded-lg ring-1 ring-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50" id="faq">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 divide-y divide-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200">
      <details class="group p-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><h3 class="font-semibold">How long does sourcing take?</h3><span class="ml-4 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700">48 hours from project specs to pricing options. Complex projects may take 3–5 days.</p></details>
      <details class="group p-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><h3 class="font-semibold">Do you source to spec or recommend products?</h3><span class="ml-4 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700">Both. We source your specified products or design the right BOM with options and rationale.</p></details>
      <details class="group p-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><h3 class="font-semibold">Do I have to buy from you?</h3><span class="ml-4 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700">Your choice. Buy from us or from suppliers we recommend. We’re flexible.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Let’s Talk About Your Next Project</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">Your next project doesn’t need to slow down because of sourcing. Tell us about it in 2 minutes.</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/contact#project" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-brand-green px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow hover:bg-emerald-600">Describe Your Project</a>
      <a href="/contact#call" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-brand-blue px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-blue hover:bg-blue-50">Schedule a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
